1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:14,178
The finished Hartman kitchen: 171" of cabinets from wall to wall.

2
00:00:14,178 --> 00:00:24,008
Drawer bases at both ends, the 36" sink base in the middle, two pantries on the right.

3
00:00:24,008 --> 00:00:29,215
Plan view: one straight run along the back wall of the 171" x 144" room.

4
00:00:29,215 --> 00:00:35,844
Elevation: symmetric about the sink, with the uppers and pantries all topping out at 84".

5
00:00:35,844 --> 00:00:39,176
The job header keeps the totals: parts and sheets for the whole kitchen.

6
00:00:39,176 --> 00:00:45,714
The Cut list tab has every part, ready for the shop.

7
00:00:45,714 --> 00:00:53,076
Nesting lays all the parts out on full sheets, listed down the left.

8
00:00:53,076 --> 00:00:56,478
From an empty room to a full kitchen, all from library presets.
